#: {{cot|en|father-in-law|mother-out-law}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Scared of this? You must be lutraphobic|magazine=w:The Daily Mail|url=https://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-507472/Scared--You-lutraphobic.html|date=10-01-2008|passage=Odontophobia, or the fear of dental work, seems equally plausible, as does pentheraphobia - fear of the '''mother-in-law'''.}}
